  "description": "Given an array of products and a searchWord, return a list of lists of the top 3 lexicographical suggestions after each character of searchWord is typed.",
  "target": "mobile",
  "pseudocode": "1. products.sort()\n2. results = []\n3. prefix = ''\n4. for char in searchWord:\n5.   prefix += char\n6.   suggestions = products.filter(p => p.startsWith(prefix))\n7.   results.push(suggestions.slice(0, 3))",
